Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Cosmic Era 72
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:10.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球·Plant之間歷時一年半的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:15.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於在雅金·多維宇域的戰鬥中迎來了終結
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:18.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,經過雙方同意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:22.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在過去的悲劇發生地猶尼奧斯七號上締結的條約
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:26.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成為雙方今後相互理解努力追求和平的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:31.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界再次開始走向安定...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:36.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但過強的力量又會招來爭端
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:37.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:42.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為爭端無法消除所以才需要力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:45.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.85,0:00:51.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能讓你死在這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:56.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又一台
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:09.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:12.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還想打仗嗎 你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喚來戰爭之物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:49.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那也是新型機嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:08.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,GUNDAM
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:12.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 沒有那台機體的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:13.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:19.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:31.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 命令是捕獲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:34.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該明白吧 那是我們軍的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:37.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白 但不知道能否做到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:41.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 為什麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:52.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼那麼簡單就被敵人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.97,0:03:55.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不是說這種話的時候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是演習 專注點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是奪取部隊的話外部應該有母艦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:04.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裏怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:14.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用庫拉堤絲說我們也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴她不用多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:25.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:26.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慎重點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:29.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried 一號二號啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:33.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈發射管一號到八號裝填korinthos
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.57,0:04:36.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊薩機 哈拉達機 到彈射器就位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主炮瞄準 左舷前方納斯卡級
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射同時解除海市蜃樓系統
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:43.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎最大系統
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:47.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總算開始有趣些了 諸位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:50.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:06.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哈賽魯 中彈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:09.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈正在接近福利葉 數量18
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉到不明艦船 數量1
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Orange25 Mark8 Bravo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:14.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離2300
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:17.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海市蜃樓系統？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:18.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是地球軍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,熱噴資料對照 無該艦種
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:24.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迎擊 派出艦船 還有MS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:29.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,納斯卡級接近 距離1900
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS出動後 抬頭20
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:34.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主炮瞄準 Indigo 納斯卡級
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別打中不該打的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:27.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:30.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:32.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,外部來的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:33.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,港口嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:41.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:42.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,演習的時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希丁克 剛才那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:52.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:54.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接應的時間到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:55.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:56.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,公車要開走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:58.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:01.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新型機不是只有三台嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:06.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,預定裏沒那東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:10.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,切 尼奧那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但不能坐視不管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到時候被追擊的話更麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還想帶份見面禮回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:28.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就別說的那麼遜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:33.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:55.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:57.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抓緊了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:00.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:07.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:12.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:19.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:27.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:36.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別想再...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:41.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼囂張
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快 能進去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:47.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,內部的損傷還不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別認為會和平常一樣運轉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:55.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認為不行的話馬上撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:01.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開 露娜瑪利亞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:09.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼港口不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:13.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰在負責這裏的指揮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:15.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那三台機體怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向我說明情況
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:18.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:21.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏還很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:24.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經產生有毒瓦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:26.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長請去防空洞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:28.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能這樣做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:30.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連事態還沒搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:34.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是... 那至少請到密涅瓦號去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:48.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 這台新型機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:50.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Chaos Gaia Abyss 全都...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 為什麼打不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:57.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:03.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:11.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再接一招
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:14.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:24.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 看你還敢狂妄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:27.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希丁克 沒完沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.03,0:10:29.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這又是張鬼牌嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:35.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤離
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:36.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:37.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能甩掉他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:39.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上打下他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:44.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 我...我...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:49.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:50.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤離
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:51.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停手 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:55.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把他...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:56.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:10:59.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就死在這裏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.90,0:11:01.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:04.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼奧那裏我會代你去說的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說永別
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:18.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:20.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:21.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:24.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止不了她 沒辦法的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:26.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住嘴 傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:27.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,圓滿結束就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:38.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:55.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,醫療隊D班到第七碼頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:02.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,E區不行了 能動的機體去密涅瓦的機庫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:04.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對 傷患也去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:14.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:16.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:19.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 沒克制住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就找安全的地方放你下去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:24.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:28.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:36.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,納斯卡級擊沉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:38.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舷後方有GuAIZ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:39.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新出現3台
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:45.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反光線爆雷發射同時 進行10秒20%的加速
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一號到四號SledgeHammer裝填
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,招回MS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:52.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:53.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒出現
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:56.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失敗了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:01.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算擊毀港口
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:02.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裏是軍事工廠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:05.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拖久了我方會頂不住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:06.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:13.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有搞砸的可能我當初也不會選他們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:16.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去爭取時間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:18.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,船就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:18.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:21.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,格納庫 Exus出擊 準備好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:30.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是些什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:32.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能這樣駕駛剛搶來的機體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被他們逃脫就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前無論如何要逮住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:42.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然明白...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:45.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 司令部沒有回答
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.69,0:13:48.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,工廠內產生瓦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:52.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,SBAS到RONAL區域發出了4級避難通知
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:56.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 這可不太妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果讓他們就這樣逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會允許這種事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:14.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 到底是哪里的部隊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:16.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣大膽的作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.57,0:14:36.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:40.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:43.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,情況呢 到底怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:06.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦 空影系統
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:08.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,許可 發射吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:14.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒有什麼秘密了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:15.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:18.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空影系統發射準備
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有完沒完
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,纏人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:33.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始空影系統發射程式
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全部系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:38.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幻影飛翼設置在平臺上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:41.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中央彈射器接通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:43.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急工作人員請待命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:08.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:20.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別想得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:34.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:16:59.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:01.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會換裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但就算如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.34,0:17:24.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別過來 滾一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:26.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:46.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:48.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:52.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:55.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們怎麼自作主張
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:57.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,外面還有敵艦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:18:00.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse的能量進入危險區域
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最多只剩300
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:06.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再損失Impulse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓密涅瓦出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:13.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 塔里婭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:24.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:27.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,借我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裏的兩個人 不許動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:37.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦出擊程式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:40.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦開始轉換為戰鬥狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.33,0:18:46.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,FCS接通 裝備人員將所有應急炮彈設定為等級1
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長也請趕快下船
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:53.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,塔里婭 這種情況可不能留下等報告了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:55.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.97,0:18:58.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我既有許可權也有義務
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:18:59.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請下許可
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.65,0:19:03.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦即將出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,工作人員請進入工作崗位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:07.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:09.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:10.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:12.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是軍人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼坐在那個機體裏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把槍放下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:25.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是奧布聯合首長國首相
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:27.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,加嘉莉·尤拉·阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:29.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是隨從阿雷克斯·里諾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.43,0:19:34.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會見狄蘭達爾議長時被捲入騷動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:37.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因未能及時避難而借用了這台機體
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的阿斯哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:42.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相負傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:45.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長也到這裏了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:46.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想馬上見他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:54.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 暫時撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:56.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,摸黑沖出去也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:00.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:03.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這的確算是我的失誤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:07.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.97,0:20:10.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:15.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅阿諾克大佐來電
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:21.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,格蒂·魯朝Blue18 Mark13 Alpha進發
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:29.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通知所有系統控制員
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.78,0:20:34.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從現在開始LHM-EB01密涅瓦的識別信號開始有效
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:38.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦開始進入緊急出擊程式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:40.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發出A55區域警報
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:43.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所有緊急艙門控制隊伍待命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:47.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二和第五隊準備對應突發性船體破損
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:49.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開啟艙門控制
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:51.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦繼續下降中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.89,0:20:54.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,監視屏B隊監測減壓區域
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:58.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這船要去避難嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:01.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Plant的損傷那麼嚴重嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:06.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊艙門內減壓完成
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:07.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,隨時可以出發
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:13.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎啟動 密涅瓦出擊 紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.93,0:21:16.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦出擊 下令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:18.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:21.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員請立即到D4區域集合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:24.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這艘船要外出戰鬥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:26.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:29.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:40.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:45.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來 這台機體也收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:48.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.40,0:23:27.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,染紅天際的火光
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.85,0:23:29.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,轟鳴的炮聲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.50,0:23:33.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼東西醒來的信號嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:38.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,相遇的年輕戰士們眼神中流露出什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:43.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.04,0:23:45.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,預兆的炮火
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:49.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎最大 出擊 密涅瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
